{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_root_iff_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_root_iff_inv","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColourCubicDiscriminant.lean#L65-L74","doc":"Hence `z` is a root of `D` iff `z⁻¹` is, for `z ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_reciprocal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_reciprocal","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColourCubicDiscriminant.lean#L58-L63","doc":"**Reciprocity.** `z⁶ · D(z⁻¹) = D(z)` for `z ≠ 0`: branch points come in pairs `z ↔ 1/z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_zero","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColourCubicDiscriminant.lean#L48-L50","doc":"The discriminant at `z = 0` (the probe's base point) is `−16`; not a branch point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_sos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant_sos","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColourCubicDiscriminant.lean#L43-L46","doc":"**Sum of squares.** `D(z) = (4z³ + 3z² + 3z + 4)² + 2z²(z² + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ColourCubicDiscriminant.colourDiscriminant","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ColourCubicDiscriminant.lean#L38-L41","doc":"The sextic `D(z) = 16z⁶ + 24z⁵ + 35z⁴ + 50z³ + 35z² + 24z + 16`; the `X`-discriminant of the\ncolour cubic is `−D(z)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}